      "answer": "```python\nimport base64\nimport zlib\n\ndef desempaquetar(texto):\n    if not texto:\n        return \"\"\n    \n    # Decodificar de base64 a bytes\n    decoded_bytes = base64.b64decode(texto)\n    \n    # Descomprimir con zlib\n    decompressed_bytes = zlib.decompress(decoded_bytes)\n    \n    # Decodificar a string UTF-8\n    return_text = decompressed_bytes.decode('utf-8')\n    \n    return return_text\n```",
